  <subsection>
  	<title>Specifications for excellence</title>
	<p>To earn <em>math &amp; writing excellent</em>, do all of these:</p>
	
	<ol>
		<li><p>First complete everything for the draft and writing revision, above</p></li>
		<li>One more</li>
	</ol>
